  "_doc": "Per-locale pronunciation overrides for the Kokoro TTS engine. When a term in this dictionary appears in a chunk, the renderer wraps it with an espeak-phonemizer hint so the synthesized audio says it correctly. Terms NOT in this dictionary use Kokoro's default pronunciation (which is generally good but routinely mangles brand names, neighborhood names, and acronyms).",
